{"version":1,"content":"<p>豐太郎在每月插畫欄目中重新採用老年孫悟空的構想，繪製出這一角色的新版形象。鳥山明約37年前也曾畫過老年孫悟空，兩幅作品並列後在社交平台廣泛傳播。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/comic/1586934.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.438812+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:15:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:56.974420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:56.974420+00:00","content_hash":"8e6b6001c1a3d67a597daa51af451fe5a99da7d62f3a7b5f42785c36beca1e8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}